345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (The literature review identifies a critical research gap in the analysis of personal, small-scale digital libraries, noting that current studies often prioritize "Big Data" over individual player habits. By examining the evolution of universal managers like Playnite, the review establishes the necessity of using formal statistical tests and data cleaning to ensure that playtime metrics accurately reflect high-quality engagement.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
