/P 244 0 R
/E (The gaming library dataset consists of 79 total games, with the primary analysis focusing on a subset of 72 titles that hold a "Played" status and a play count greater than zero. These active games span six distinct platforms, including the Nintendo Switch, Nintendo Switch 2, PC \(Windows\), and Sony PlayStation 3, 4, and 5, while being organized into seven core categories: Action, Arcade, Fighting, RPG, Shooter, Simulation, and Survival. By filtering titles with confirmed session activity, this 72-game dataset serves as the standardized basis for all descriptive and correlational statistical measures presented in this report.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
